WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:45.830 --> 01:48.660
Heh, things in the human world aren't too bad at all.

01:49.620 --> 01:52.210
This pistachio ice cream isn't shabby, either.

01:52.210 --> 01:53.310
Ah~!

01:53.310 --> 01:53.940
Huh?

01:53.940 --> 01:56.210
That lace cami is so cute!

01:58.210 --> 02:00.950
Ah! That turquoise jewelry is so cool!

02:03.050 --> 02:04.020
Ah! Over here!

02:04.420 --> 02:05.690
And there!

02:07.460 --> 02:10.420
Well, girls are the same no matter where they are.

02:10.760 --> 02:11.160
Yeah.

02:11.660 --> 02:12.890
Over there! Over there!

02:14.930 --> 02:17.700
The Magic Knights Action Show is going on, I heard!

02:17.970 --> 02:20.370
Ah! Coco-chan is here, too! I'm going!

02:21.840 --> 02:22.840
Let's go! Let's go!

02:25.440 --> 02:27.370
Hey, what the heck is "Magic Knights"?

02:28.040 --> 02:28.910
No idea...

02:31.780 --> 02:33.550
Chocolat Becomes An Idol!

03:08.320 --> 03:09.320
What the heck?

03:10.190 --> 03:12.290
Hey, isn't that...

03:12.990 --> 03:13.420
Huh?!

03:18.190 --> 03:20.260
Mimura, you guys all came to see this?!

03:20.500 --> 03:24.220
O-of course!
"Magical Soldiers Magic Knights!"

03:24.700 --> 03:26.500
They're a huge hit on TV.

03:26.900 --> 03:28.300
You guys came to see them too, right?

03:30.870 --> 03:34.140
We were just showing Houx and Saule around town.

03:34.910 --> 03:37.780
Why would I ever be interested
in something so childish?

03:38.250 --> 03:41.110
W-we also, rather than the Magic Knights...!

03:41.450 --> 03:41.450
Coco-chan! We came to see Coco-chan!

03:45.120 --> 03:45.880
Coco-chan?

03:55.460 --> 03:56.600
Eh? That's...

03:57.270 --> 03:59.170
Hello, everyone!

03:59.170 --> 04:01.570
Hello!!!

04:02.940 --> 04:04.910
Ah! So cute!

04:06.170 --> 04:07.340
See? See?

04:07.780 --> 04:10.180
Isn't that magic awesome?

04:10.180 --> 04:10.610
Eh?

04:11.180 --> 04:14.510
She acts like a real witch and uses magic.

04:15.320 --> 04:16.980
Although they're just tricks, of course.

04:17.520 --> 04:18.120
Tricks?

04:18.950 --> 04:21.820
Ah. I see, tricks, huh?

04:57.260 --> 04:59.060
Try to stand against the Magic Knights...

05:03.730 --> 05:05.270
...and we'll take you down!

05:08.000 --> 05:10.810
Cool! Coco-chan is awesome!

05:10.810 --> 05:11.200
Mm!

05:14.280 --> 05:17.960
Who is this magic soldier really?
Only you know the se-cr-et!

05:17.960 --> 05:20.380
Houx-hoo! You're so cool, Coco-chan!

05:20.820 --> 05:22.250
She's my type-kero...

05:22.720 --> 05:25.320
That action is really something.

05:30.330 --> 05:34.360
She is nothing more than a human
girl! She's nothing too great.

05:36.700 --> 05:39.600
I was thinking that Coco-chan
might actually be a real witch.

05:42.640 --> 05:44.340
Don't be stupid, Chocolat!

05:45.270 --> 05:48.220
She just looks like she uses magic on TV.

05:48.220 --> 05:51.730
There's no way the Magic Knights
can be real witches.

05:52.210 --> 05:56.220
Taiji-kun was also saying that Coco-chan
was very good at tricks.

05:56.750 --> 05:58.390
Yeah, that's right!

06:04.930 --> 06:12.470
Hello? Ah, Mimura? Yeah, I just
saw it. With Vanilla and Houx.

06:13.060 --> 06:15.270
Eh?! A studio tour?!

06:15.640 --> 06:21.170
Yeah, my uncle knows someone working for
the TV station that produces Magic Knights,

06:21.580 --> 06:23.650
and I have been asking him for a while now...

06:24.180 --> 06:26.010
Eh? Tomorrow?

06:26.750 --> 06:27.550
What's wrong?

06:28.280 --> 06:33.780
Listen! Listen! We can go on a tour to the studio
where they shoot Magic Knights! Shall we go?

06:34.160 --> 06:35.290
Let's go!

06:36.120 --> 06:39.430
Ah, Vanilla-chama has such weird interests...

06:39.990 --> 06:41.360
Well then, me too.

06:41.360 --> 06:43.700
Ehh? Are you serious, Houx?

06:43.700 --> 06:45.370
That's not what I mean.

06:46.030 --> 06:49.140
It's decided! We'll go! Everyone's going!

07:00.950 --> 07:03.750
Ehh! Cool! This is so fun!

07:04.120 --> 07:06.310
It's a bit different from normal TV stations.

07:07.190 --> 07:10.720
A dusty place like this is not
suitable for Vanilla-chama!

07:11.390 --> 07:13.890
Stop whining or go home!

07:14.560 --> 07:18.660
Shut up! I just can't abandon Vanilla-chama!

07:18.900 --> 07:20.400
The studio is this way.

07:21.170 --> 07:22.770
It's bigger than I thought.

07:25.810 --> 07:27.670
Huh? That's so cute!

07:30.610 --> 07:31.180
Huh?

07:32.410 --> 07:33.410
Where'd everyone go?

07:33.880 --> 07:35.720
It's your fault for not watching the others!

07:36.520 --> 07:39.220
Neither were you! I'll whup your butt!

07:40.190 --> 07:40.880
No more!

07:45.860 --> 07:46.790
Sorry!

07:47.860 --> 07:51.930
That pendant...are you from the Magic World, too?

07:52.970 --> 07:56.240
Coco-chan, you can't go out alone like that!

07:56.240 --> 07:56.910
Coco...

08:00.510 --> 08:03.740
I understand what you were saying,
but we can talk about it later.

08:03.740 --> 08:06.180
The afternoon shoot is starting soon.

08:25.630 --> 08:29.370
Uhm...uhm, uhm, uhm... are you also
from the Magic World, Coco?

08:36.010 --> 08:41.110
Ah-ha! I thought so! I couldn't believe
your magic was mere tricks!

08:41.650 --> 08:44.450
Vanilla and the others didn't believe me!

08:45.520 --> 08:46.820
They're all from the Magic World.

08:47.320 --> 08:49.120
Eh? Others, too?

08:49.720 --> 08:54.190
I thought that it was mostly adults
here...but also so many...

08:54.530 --> 08:55.730
That makes me happy for some reason.

08:56.330 --> 09:00.600
Me too! Everyone will be so happy
once they find out you're a witch!

09:01.670 --> 09:02.270
Really?

09:02.940 --> 09:09.640
Yeah! Were all big fans! We got a special
invite to come see the shoot today!

09:10.080 --> 09:11.480
Ah! I'm Chocolat.

09:12.510 --> 09:15.420
My real name is Coconut.

09:16.120 --> 09:18.650
Sorry about earlier, being all weird like that.

09:19.950 --> 09:22.460
Doing this kind of job, I have to deal
with some bothersome stuff...

09:24.230 --> 09:27.190
No problem. That's totally fine!

09:28.760 --> 09:31.460
It's been such a long time since I last
met people from the Magic World!

09:31.870 --> 09:33.530
How's everything over there? No big change?

09:33.940 --> 09:36.500
Yeah. Haven't returned for a while, huh?

09:36.500 --> 09:38.670
Y-yeah...busy with work, you know...

09:40.710 --> 09:44.110
Ah! The Magic Knight costume! How cool!

09:44.910 --> 09:45.580
Wanna try it on?

09:46.410 --> 09:47.250
Can I?

09:47.250 --> 09:51.920
Mmh! It should fit your size. I'm relatively short.

09:51.920 --> 09:55.590
Yahoo! I can brag to Vanilla and the others!

09:55.590 --> 09:56.460
So, this way.

10:02.530 --> 10:03.330
How's it look?

10:04.900 --> 10:06.630
It fits perfectly, just as I thought!

10:07.000 --> 10:11.460
Nice n' flexible! Anyone who stands against
the Magic Knights, I'll whup your butt!

10:11.970 --> 10:15.380
Great! You could be Magic Rouge!

10:17.180 --> 10:18.010
You think so?

10:18.350 --> 10:19.010
Wanna try it?

10:19.410 --> 10:20.610
Mmh! I do, I do!

10:22.920 --> 10:26.490
Don't worry, I'm sure you can do it. Okay?

10:32.830 --> 10:34.980
Coco? Where'd you go, Coco?

10:35.500 --> 10:38.260
She disappeared! She magically disappeared!

10:38.730 --> 10:39.700
Then you mean...?!

10:41.740 --> 10:46.110
Coco-chan? Were about to start
the filming. Ready to come out?

11:02.820 --> 11:03.860
Well, shall we go?

11:04.990 --> 11:06.990
What's wrong? Everyone's waiting.

11:07.430 --> 11:08.960
Wh-what should I do?

11:10.930 --> 11:14.130
Don't worry, I'm sure you can do it. Okay?

11:15.940 --> 11:16.870
Alright.

11:20.610 --> 11:21.040
Okay.

11:24.210 --> 11:25.350
What do we do now?

11:26.360 --> 11:29.950
I don't know! But now that I agreed to this...

11:30.550 --> 11:34.550
And if they find out that Coco-chan is gone,
it will be a huge problem, right?

11:35.120 --> 11:38.830
Eh? You have to replace her? That's impossible!

11:38.830 --> 11:41.900
Don't say that! Alright! I'll do it!

11:51.340 --> 11:53.540
As I thought, Chocolat-chan's not here.

11:54.080 --> 11:56.010
I wonder if she got lost.

11:57.380 --> 11:59.360
She's probably in the bathroom.

11:59.950 --> 12:02.620
She's in this building for sure.

12:03.280 --> 12:04.380
She'll come back.

12:04.850 --> 12:05.550
But...

12:05.550 --> 12:06.920
Ah! It's Coco-chan!

12:08.890 --> 12:09.720
Coco-chan!

12:15.030 --> 12:17.360
Ah! Vanilla! It's me! Me!

12:22.770 --> 12:25.370
Okay, Coco-chan—next scene, please.

12:25.710 --> 12:26.640
"Next scene"?

12:27.170 --> 12:29.280
You know, the scene we just rehearsed.

12:29.280 --> 12:29.640
Oops!

12:29.640 --> 12:32.580
Huh? Your voice is kind of strange, are you okay?

12:33.080 --> 12:38.590
Uh, well, I ate something really
spicy, ack! It really hurt!

12:39.250 --> 12:42.360
Take care. Okay. Places!

12:46.730 --> 12:48.760
Coco-chan, that's not your place!

12:49.500 --> 12:56.000
Eh? But this is the head seat! And I'm the
fan favorite, right? So I should sit here!

12:56.970 --> 13:00.110
Just a second, stop kidding around.

13:00.740 --> 13:02.510
That place is my seat.

13:03.710 --> 13:06.310
Oh, it is, isn't it? It was a joke! A joke!

13:08.520 --> 13:11.050
Coco's image is totally different in person.

13:11.990 --> 13:14.590
Her body seems to have regressed all of a sudden.

13:15.160 --> 13:16.860
Not as sexy as I thought...

13:17.460 --> 13:21.430
Looks like someone I know...that bossy behavior.

13:22.700 --> 13:24.930
Okay, places! Action!

13:26.130 --> 13:30.620
Magic Knights, we now have
a new enemy before us.

13:31.040 --> 13:32.110
What'd you say?

13:37.040 --> 13:38.750
Oh no! They have invaded us already!

13:48.790 --> 13:50.890
Wh-what the?! I'll whup your butt!

14:03.270 --> 14:04.570
CUT! CUT!!!

14:14.280 --> 14:15.450
Phew!

14:17.420 --> 14:19.390
Just as I thought, you can't do it.

14:19.720 --> 14:20.450
Shut up!

14:21.890 --> 14:25.290
Robin-sama! I'm so glad!

14:25.930 --> 14:26.730
I knew it.

14:27.530 --> 14:30.830
What timing! You can ask Robin to help you!

14:31.530 --> 14:36.360
But, if I ask Robin to help me,

14:36.940 --> 14:41.140
You're a Queen Candidate, what
should you do in this situation?!

14:41.910 --> 14:43.740
...or something like that.

14:48.420 --> 14:50.720
It seems she was an hour late...

14:50.720 --> 14:51.920
I see, really?

14:53.520 --> 14:55.360
I'm sorry, Chocolat-chan.

15:02.160 --> 15:03.600
I...it's so high!

15:04.430 --> 15:09.440
In short, at the climax you swoop down
and save the rest of the Magic Knights!

15:10.300 --> 15:11.640
Make it look really cool!

15:12.240 --> 15:14.280
But how am I supposed to get down there?!

15:14.280 --> 15:17.940
Well, you know... you always do one of your tricks.

15:18.250 --> 15:19.380
Eh? Tricks?

15:20.050 --> 15:21.220
You always manage somehow...

15:21.220 --> 15:22.780
Climbing up buildings,

15:23.520 --> 15:27.220
Dancing with lions...we always just let you handle it.

15:28.090 --> 15:30.490
"Please, just let me take care of the stunts!"

15:30.490 --> 15:31.160
Eh?!

15:31.730 --> 15:33.630
I never said anything like that.

15:33.630 --> 15:36.930
How about flying on a kite like a ninja or something?

15:38.000 --> 15:39.900
Well, we're counting on you
to handle this one!

15:42.240 --> 15:46.940
Man, I've never been able to do flying
magic properly! What should I do?!

15:47.540 --> 15:49.580
I think our questions have all been answered.

15:49.980 --> 15:50.340
Eh?

15:50.980 --> 15:52.950
Mmh. I think so, too.

15:53.510 --> 15:55.520
That person up there isn't Coco-chan, is it?

15:56.280 --> 15:58.120
Eh?! Then, who is it?

15:59.550 --> 16:02.290
You know there's one person
we haven't seen for a while...

16:02.720 --> 16:04.060
Chocolat-chan?!

16:04.060 --> 16:05.220
That's exactly right!

16:07.390 --> 16:09.400
If only I had a broom at least!

16:09.400 --> 16:11.830
Let's start! Places!

16:12.500 --> 16:14.470
I just have to do it, no matter what!

16:14.970 --> 16:15.740
Action!

16:17.000 --> 16:19.470
A real witch? Coco-chan?!

16:21.140 --> 16:22.840
Chocolat was right, after all.

16:23.540 --> 16:25.910
And then? Where did she go off to?

16:25.910 --> 16:27.480
I haven't a clue...

16:27.920 --> 16:29.120
Here I go!

16:33.020 --> 16:35.660
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

16:41.100 --> 16:41.690
Wand!

16:50.640 --> 16:51.440
Alright!

16:54.110 --> 16:56.610
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

16:57.480 --> 16:59.610
A flying kite, appear!

17:11.490 --> 17:13.560
This isn't exactly right, but...okay!

17:16.700 --> 17:19.400
Awesome! You're so cool, Coco-chan!

17:19.970 --> 17:21.730
You did it, Chocolat-chan!

17:31.050 --> 17:31.980
You are...

17:33.050 --> 17:34.280
Rockin' Robin-san!

17:34.720 --> 17:36.880
What's with the gloomy face?

17:37.680 --> 17:39.190
That's not what I'd expect from Coco-chan.

17:47.430 --> 17:48.500
See?

17:50.260 --> 17:56.040
As a fellow superstar, I knew about
you...and the fact you are a witch.

17:57.070 --> 18:00.110
Why would you sacrifice Chocolat
in order to escape?

18:00.940 --> 18:06.850
I'm tired of it all. It's like my schedule's
never-ending, it's awful.

18:07.270 --> 18:10.020
I can understand how you feel, but...

18:10.450 --> 18:13.120
I came to this world to run away from home.

18:13.620 --> 18:16.690
I rebelled against my strict parents.

18:18.060 --> 18:18.990
I know.

18:19.930 --> 18:23.760
Really? I was quickly scouted.

18:23.760 --> 18:29.040
And I thought I could spite my parents by becoming a star and earning lots of Ecures.

18:30.640 --> 18:33.870
Really. Well, then, haven't you
seen your parents since?

18:34.270 --> 18:37.540
No, I have never returned to the Magic World.

18:38.300 --> 18:39.010
I see.

18:39.950 --> 18:41.410
Irresponsible, aren't I?

18:42.520 --> 18:44.450
I also caused Chocolat-chan a lot of trouble.

18:47.450 --> 18:51.290
What'll you do?
Are you going to quit this job?

19:01.740 --> 19:02.470
That's...

19:08.940 --> 19:10.940
Try to stand against the Magic Knights...

19:15.450 --> 19:17.050
...and we'll take you down!

19:18.950 --> 19:19.850
CUT!

19:20.490 --> 19:22.820
Yes! That was great! Great!

19:22.820 --> 19:24.220
Great work, Coco-chan!

19:24.530 --> 19:26.730
It's so awesome to see her live!

19:26.730 --> 19:28.230
Coco-chan, you're so cool!

19:28.830 --> 19:30.100
It went well!

19:30.700 --> 19:31.230
Yeah!

19:31.900 --> 19:34.100
This was a piece of cake!

19:34.100 --> 19:36.870
I could do the Magic Knights every week!

19:37.570 --> 19:39.970
Now, for Coco-chan's final speech!

19:39.970 --> 19:40.610
Let's go!

19:41.240 --> 19:41.990
Okay!

19:42.710 --> 19:44.700
Then, take off your mask.

19:47.850 --> 19:49.620
Huh? Coco-chan, what's wrong?

19:51.220 --> 19:52.820
No...this is bad.

19:54.390 --> 19:55.120
Coco-chan?

19:59.930 --> 20:02.260
This is bad. I'll be discovered!

20:05.870 --> 20:06.830
Chocolat-chan.

20:07.400 --> 20:09.040
If you please, Magic Knight.

20:12.730 --> 20:13.660
Right.

20:13.840 --> 20:15.650
Ready? Action!

20:15.910 --> 20:18.980
Eek! Coco-chan, I'm sorry!

20:21.920 --> 20:22.680
Hi!

20:23.350 --> 20:27.650
Who is this magic soldier really?
Only you know the se-cr-et!

20:29.120 --> 20:30.420
Cut! Okay!

20:34.130 --> 20:35.530
She made it.

20:36.000 --> 20:38.880
I thought I was done for! You're a life-saver!

20:39.470 --> 20:41.970
Thank goodness! I was so worried!

20:42.600 --> 20:44.940
You were searching for Coco-chan, Robin-sensei?

20:45.470 --> 20:46.810
Mere coincidence.

20:47.370 --> 20:50.980
Either way, no one found out! Great job, Chocolat!

20:53.310 --> 20:55.950
Though it was quite a peculiar Coco!

21:00.920 --> 21:02.290
Thank you, Chocolat-chan.

21:06.260 --> 21:08.900
So you see, she was homesick.

21:08.900 --> 21:12.700
And her job here was keeping her
so busy, she could hardly take off.

21:13.230 --> 21:16.570
Even if she wanted to go back home,
her pride wouldn't allow her to.

21:17.000 --> 21:18.570
Oh. Really?

21:19.040 --> 21:21.540
Okay, I've got one more job to do!

21:21.980 --> 21:22.280
Huh?

21:42.460 --> 21:43.530
Coconut.

21:45.170 --> 21:47.170
Papa. Mama.

21:48.670 --> 21:49.800
I'm sorry!

21:52.470 --> 21:54.910
Now we can watch Magic Knights again!

21:55.580 --> 21:57.680
Looks like it. Later.

21:58.510 --> 22:01.980
Hey! Kato! Where'd you run off to?

22:01.980 --> 22:05.720
Oh nothing, just practicing to be a Magic Knight!

22:06.290 --> 22:06.990
Practice?

22:09.420 --> 22:13.160
Try to stand against the Magic Knights,
and I'll whup your butt! Thanks!

22:23.080 --> 22:29.390
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.520 --> 22:30.890
"Love"

22:31.830 --> 22:35.330
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.770
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.200 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.950 --> 23:00.220
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.820 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.190 --> 23:11.260
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.630 --> 23:16.070
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.070 --> 23:26.180
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.240 --> 23:35.090
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:47.080 --> 23:50.570
Oh crap! My grandpa's visiting from the Magic World!

23:50.570 --> 23:53.140
What should I do?! What should I do?! What should I do?!

23:53.140 --> 23:55.140
Why'd you have to come, all of a sudden?!

23:55.850 --> 24:00.490
Ah! Robin! Duke! Running away like that isn't fair!

24:00.490 --> 24:02.800
Don't leave me with him!

24:04.070 --> 24:06.400
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:06.400 --> 24:09.210
Grandpa Invades! Love Dance Showdown!

24:09.950 --> 24:13.400
At this rate, I'm going to have my butt whupped!
